Error [E0112]: `ExpiringSecret.new` wants `Clock` for argument 3, but this is Int (a whole number)
  --> expiring_secret_rejects_non_clock_observers_in_sema.jet:8:46
    |
  8 |     _ := vault.ExpiringSecret.new(^key, ttl, 42)
    |                                              ^^
 Why: Secret expiry must observe the explicitly injected clock
 Fix: Use `Clock.new(...)` for deterministic code or `Clock.system()` for production
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
